## 2. CacheNameResolver — EXISTS
**Path:** `/workspace/repo/common/cache/src/main/java/org/thingsboard/mqtt/broker/cache/CacheNameResolver.java`
**Package:** `org.thingsboard.mqtt.broker.cache`

It already exists. Full contents:
```java
@Component
@Data
public class CacheNameResolver {

    private final CacheManager cacheManager;

    @Value("${cache.cache-prefix:}")
    private String cachePrefix;

    public Cache getCache(String cacheName) {
        return cacheManager.getCache(cachePrefix + cacheName);
    }
}
```
It is the central accessor: wraps a Spring `CacheManager`, prepends a configurable `cache.cache-prefix`, and returns a Spring `Cache` by name. `@Data` (Lombok) generates the constructor for the final `cacheManager` field.

